Subject: [RMX2072 M3] opt-in first-frame trace without changing error handling

Apply after trial 67 patches. Tracepoints default off; bounded raw samples
precede IRQ clearing and record first command-mode kickoff/completion.
No interrupt mask, reset, OPP, PPS, PHY or panel command changes.

